@startuml
title 智颐养老系统 - 健康评估AI解析流程图

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8FF
  BorderColor #2E4D7B
}

start
:护理人员上传体检报告(PDF);

:HealthAssessmentController\n@PostMapping("/upload");

:阿里云OSS上传体检报告;
note right
  aliyunOSSOperator
  .upload()
end note

:保存文件URL到响应体;

:PDFUtil.pdfToString()\n提取PDF文本内容;

:Redis Hash存储\nkey: "healthReport"\nfield: idCardNo\nvalue: PDF文本;
note right
  TTL: 24小时
  确保用户一天内
  可完成提交
end note

:返回OSS URL給前端;

:前端回显报告信息;

:护理人员录入评估信息;

:前端调用\nPOST /nursing/healthAssessment;

:HealthAssessmentController\n@PostMapping("/");

:insertHealthAssessment();

if (是否需要AI评估?) then (是)
  :从Redis读取PDF文本;

  :组装AI Prompt\n(包含PDF文本+评估要求);

  :AIModelInvoker.qianfanInvoker(prompt);
  note right
    百度千帆 Ernie 5.0
    OpenAI兼容API
    返回JSON格式结果
  end note

  :解析AI返回JSON;
  note right
    包含:
    - healthScore
    - riskLevel
    - suggestionForAdmission
    - nursingLevelName
    - reportSummary
    - diseaseRisk
    - abnormalAnalysis
    - systemScore
  end note

  :保存AI补充评估结果;
else (否)
  :仅保存基础信息;
endif

:返回评估ID;

stop
@enduml
